# Public connection inputs only. Empty means not configured.
# This file is not loaded automatically by either native application.
# The approved caller passes these explicit values to NativeConnectionConfiguration(publicValues).
# Supply the backend origin accepted for the intended candidate; HTTPS root only.
CRM_API_ORIGIN=
# Explicit caller-selected positive decimal seconds, at most 3 fractional digits; no production default.
CRM_READ_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=
# Both config parsers validate and convert to whole milliseconds without rounding/defaults.
# Do not add passwords, tokens, device identifiers, user/Business defaults or signing data here.
